## A3 resident lifecycle: an ordinary spawn is kind agent; the incarnation cannot be archived, deleted or exported out from under the Champion
```json
{
  "ordinaryKind": "agent",
  "refusals": {
    "spawn with kind: champion from a caller": "invalid_request: spawn: kind is set by champion.start, never by the caller",
    "archive the incarnation directly": "invalid_request: archive: bee f7e98479-905a-4cb1-ba4d-40398c1c1357 is the current incarnation of Champion vera-lund; use champion.archive",
    "delete the incarnation directly": "invalid_request: delete: bee f7e98479-905a-4cb1-ba4d-40398c1c1357 is the current incarnation of Champion vera-lund; use champion.archive",
    "template.delete while bound": "invalid_request: template.delete: template f8e1a349-c4c2-49cc-84fa-8959e6bf9066 is bound by Champion(s) vera-lund; rebind them with champion.put first",
    "champion.export while the incarnation runs": "runtime_refused: champion.export: incarnation f7e98479-905a-4cb1-ba4d-40398c1c1357 is running; stop it (or champion.fence) first so the home is quiet",
    "champion.start on the live incarnation": "running"
  }
}
```

